@startuml 05-llm-graphdb-pipeline
title MAESTRO LLM + GraphDB Pipeline

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1A237E
    FontStyle bold
}

actor User
rectangle "LLM Intent Extraction"               as Intent      #E8EAF6
rectangle "SPARQL Generation"                   as SPARQLGen   #C5CAE9
rectangle "GraphDB Reasoning\n(OWL · SHACL · SWRL)" as Reason   #9FA8DA
rectangle "Capability Inference"                as Inference   #7986CB
rectangle "LLM Explanation"                     as Explain     #C5CAE9
rectangle "Execution Layer\n(ROS · PLC · IEC 61499 · OPC UA)" as Exec #B2DFDB

User       --> Intent     : "Move part X to station 3"
Intent     --> SPARQLGen
SPARQLGen  --> Reason
Reason     --> Inference
Inference  --> Explain    : results
Inference  --> Exec       : dispatch

@enduml
